  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GGGI Indonesia Program 2016-19</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GGGI Indonesia Program 2016-19

This 4-year grant represent Norway&#x2019;s support for the second phase of GGGI Indonesia&#x2019;s Country Program, and will cover the period 2016-2019. In 2012, Norway and the Global Green Growth Institute (GGGI) signed an agreement to finance the first phase - a 3-year country programme on Green Growth in support of the GoI REDD+ and climate agenda, focusing on strengthening the national capacity to mainstream green growth planning into national development strategies.</narrative>
  </description>
